        "required": ["body", "buttons"],
        "description": "Linked Devices support up to 10 reply buttons or up to 3 CTA buttons; reply and CTA buttons cannot be mixed. On an official WhatsApp Business number, at most 3 `reply` buttons are sent; other button types return `501`. There, `body` allows at most 1,024 characters, `title` and `footer` at most 60, and each button needs a unique `id` and a unique `text` of at most 20 characters. Every number also limits each button `id` to 256 UTF-8 bytes. Content outside any limit returns `400`."
